================================================================================
Scope
================================================================================

This license covers the curated pool-boiling dataset associated with the paper
"Surface-Conditioned Physics-Informed Neural Network for Pool-Boiling Onset of
Nucleate Boiling" (Lee et al., 2026, International Journal of Heat and Mass
Transfer), specifically:

  - phase1_pool_boiling/02_data/processed/boiling_curves.csv  (1361 rows x 14 columns)
  - phase1_pool_boiling/02_data/processed/onb_dataset.csv     (82 rows x 12 columns)
  - phase1_pool_boiling/02_data/surface_cards/*.yaml          (49 surface descriptor cards)
  - phase1_pool_boiling/02_data/raw/digitization/*            (per-paper WebPlotDigitizer metadata)
  - phase1_pool_boiling/02_data/processed/README.md           (column schema, units, provenance)

The underlying raw figures from the seven primary references
(BETZ_2013, BOURDON_2012, BOURDON_2015, JABARDO_2009, JONES_2009, JO_2011,
PHAN_2009) are NOT redistributed.  Only the numerical values extracted via
WebPlotDigitizer, together with metadata pointing to the original
publications, are released here. Users wishing to access the underlying
figures must obtain them from the original publishers.

